  <div class="pt-note"><div class="pt-note-head">🧑‍💻 선생님 노트 · 문제 해설</div><div class="pt-note-body"><div style="margin-bottom:5px;"><b class="hl">꿔 왔어요</b> = "have been dreaming (up to now)" (-아/어 오다). So the dream started long ago and continues to the present. <b class="hl">예전부터 지금까지 계속 이어져 왔어요</b> (②) = "it has continued from before until now" — the same idea. ① is brand-new, ③ is future, ④ is giving up.</div></div></div>
